{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213530/extras/a71452e078c7d0fa97406bb4cc700ac2.avif?t=1768708378\" width=610 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Those who go to their deaths salute you!</strong> In the world of gladiators, where every fight is a struggle for survival, the arena becomes a place where blood flows in rivers. Here, in the yellow circle, where there is no place for fear and weakness, gladiators fight for their life and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features modes that allow you to test your strength in battle. In PvP mode, you can face off against other players, where every battle is a struggle for the leading position. In PvE mode you will fight against artificial intelligence to develop your skills and become even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Let's welcome the new Gladiator!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1213530/7b8fb6deb1ad0f2b1fb1389ffcdf91cbbc91493f.jpg"},{"name":"Support is very important!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1213530/0904023264dc5498d96ddc5826b9d2aca795fd5c.jpg"},{"name":"Great find!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1213530/0b78010c3bb27dcb53bd964ca18ab84dc7ec5259.jpg"},{"name":"Happy first victory, gladiator!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1213530/a68d919816a9b07fdee7adeb8ba7672e74bb18c4.jpg"},{"name":"Death to the King!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1213530/28ff068e25554d795f394b448781d86d7af415d8.jpg"},{"name":"The Nero Collection.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1213530/59311379a76e440fe4ad43e61594b9c82318a2fd.jpg"},{"name":"Reple